      "speaker": "CLIENT",
      "text": "周末摆弄花草，不用老盯着工作消息，挺舒服的。现在证件也放在手边了。 My identity card number is S nine zero seven seven six zero four Q."
    },
    {
      "turn_id": 4,
      "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
      "text": "I have your identity card number as S nine zero seven four six zero four Q. Is that accurate?"
